@startuml figure_9-5_subscriber_signup
' Chapter 9 - Simplified subscriber sign-up
' Juliette subscribes; the marketplace records her so she lands on the notification list.

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam ParticipantPadding 14

participant "Juliette /\nConsumer"    as JM
participant "Beth /\nMarketplace"     as MP
participant "Data Product/\nSidecar"  as SC

JM ->  MP : Sign up to the data product
MP ->  SC : OOCS: record subscriber
SC --> MP : OORS: subscribed

note over SC
  Juliette is now on the
  notification list.
end note

@enduml
